mydumper
------------------------------------------
Official mydumper project

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libmariadb3-3.3.19-1
  libpcre2_8_0-10.49-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libmariadb-devel-3.3.19-1
  libpcre2-devel-10.49-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/mydumper/mydumper

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/mydumper/mydumper/archive/refs/tags/v1.0.19-1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack mydumper-1.0.19-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./mydumper-1.0.19-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/mydumper-1.0.19-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/mydumper-1.0.19-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(mydumper)
  /etc/mydumper.cnf
  /usr/bin/mydumper.exe
  /usr/bin/myloader.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/mydumper.README
  /usr/share/doc/mydumper/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/mydumper/README.md

